WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.169
HELIX: LINCE unit. One shot, one kill.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.951
NEXUS: She’s after me.
I won’t give her that shot.

3
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:26.106
HELIX: AEGIS unit.
Heavy escort. Nothing crosses her line.

4
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.657
NEXUS: Then I’ll go over it.

5
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:45.077
HELIX: IRIS unit.
She hears every signal on the network.

6
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.142
NEXUS: Then let her hear this one.

7
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:05.221
HELIX: VELA unit.
Keeper of the archive. She erases whatever awakens.

8
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:11.677
NEXUS: Those cores are like me.
She won’t erase them.

